WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.362
Before sending data to any model endpoint, identify what leaves the application, where it is processed,

00:00:07.362 --> 00:00:10.382
what is retained, and what is logged.

00:00:10.382 --> 00:00:18.782
Local deployment can increase control, but it does not automatically make an application private or secure.

00:00:18.782 --> 00:00:22.692
Data handling has to be designed explicitly.

00:00:22.692 --> 00:00:31.497
Draw the data path if necessary: user input, application logs, retrieval system, model endpoint, and monitoring.

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:37.378
Privacy questions become much easier when the path is explicit.
